<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling virtually unchanged on dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling virtually unchanged on dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was virtually unchanged against the dollar, trading at a commercial mean rate of 590.4360 on Thursday versus 590.3370 on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling was dealt at a mean of 918.0129 compared to 918.7134 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
